        {
            "title": "港股跌穿23,000   騰訊阿里成跌市元兇",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股恒生指數跌破23,000關，低見22,955，瀉339點或1.45%，現跌325點或1.4%，報22,969，成交額341.22億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生科技指數跌62點或1.67，報3,673 ; 恒生國企指數跌1.31%，報7,733。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"騰訊 (AP圖片)\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/01/20250116_FI_source-ap_China_Tencent_Group-3.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"騰訊 (AP圖片)\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/01/20250116_FI_source-ap_China_Tencent_Group-3.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">騰訊 (AP圖片)</p>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">成交341.22億元。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">騰訊(00700)挫4.88%，報354.6元，拖低恒指73點 ; 阿里巴巴(09988)插5.04%，報80.95元，拖低指69點，為兩大跌市元兇。</p>\n</div>",
