        {
            "title": "滬指開市跌4點 深成指跌67點",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">內地股市初段偏軟，上證綜指以3,583點開市，跌4點或0.13%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">深證成指開市報10,591點，亦跌67點或0.63%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">滬深300指數跌11點或0.28%，開報3,972點；創業板指數開市報2,290點，跌21點或0.93%。</p>\n</div>",
