            "title": "港股開市︱初段再跌 恒指跌245點報23,049點 騰訊績後低開2.95%",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股開市初段持續下滑，恒生指數開市報23,049點，跌245點或1.05%。</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"AP圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230808_FI_source-ap_港股2.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"AP圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/704x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/04/20230808_FI_source-ap_港股2.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">AP圖片</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">恒生科技指數開報3,699點，跌36點或0.97%；國企指數以7,762點開市，跌74點或0.95%。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">騰訊(00700)昨天收市後派成績表，季度Non-IFRS純利倒退6%；該股ADR昨晚已低收逾3%，股份今早在港開報361.8元，跌2.95%。</p>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"圖片來源：騰訊官網\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/768x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/03/20250307_FI_source-web_00700.jpg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"圖片來源：騰訊官網\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/768x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2025/03/20250307_FI_source-web_00700.jpg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">圖片來源：騰訊官網</p>\n</a>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">其他重磅股亦多半偏軟，收市後公布業績的阿里巴巴(09988)，今早開報82.25元，跌3.52%；京東(09618)經昨天績後急回，今早開報98.2元，反彈0.56%。滙控(00005)開報133.1元，跌2.13%；友邦(01299)開報76.4元，跌0.59%。</p>\n</div>",
